# STRSST: the service tools sign-on. The pub400 account has no
# *SERVICE, so the command is expected to be refused with a message on
# MAIN; the snapshot records what came back. Nothing is typed into a
# service tools display: the probe leaves with F3 at once.
continue
timeout 60000
settle 3000
# Break messages at sign-on show Display Messages first: Enter goes on
# (and does nothing on MAIN).
key enter
wait "Main Menu"
type strsst
key enter
settle 2000
snap strsst
key f3
settle 1000
